# Blog post closing

End every post with a short "Hope you enjoyed..." line, then point people to X and the full bio.

Required HTML shape (raw HTML bodies):

```html
<p>Hope you enjoyed this one. … Find me on X at <a href="https://x.com/harundotdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://x.com/harundotdev</a>, and grab every other link from my bio at <a href="https://harun.dev/bio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://harun.dev/bio</a>.</p>
```

Rules:

- Always use real `<a>` tags for both URLs. Do not leave bare `https://x.com/...` text.
- Both links open in a new tab: `target="_blank"` and `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.
- Always include `https://harun.dev/bio` so readers can find other socials and links.
- Keep the wording first person and concrete. No "In summary" / "In conclusion".
- No em dashes in the closing (or elsewhere in the post).
